     "display": true
    },
    {
     "p": "Also, suppose that $Y \\equiv X(5 - X)$. Determine the PDF and CDF of $Y$. You can solve this in two ways. First, you can compute $f_{Y}(y)$ using the formula given in class:"
    },
    {
     "p": "$$f_{Y}(y) = f_{X}(g^{-1}(y))\\left|\\frac{d}{dy}g^{-1}(y)\\right|,$$",
     "display": true
    },
    {
     "p": "taking care that $g(x)$ is piece-wise monotonic. Second, you can solve this by finding $F_{Y}(y) = P[Y \\leq y]$ directly, as we did in recitation. You will receive extra-credit if you can do it both ways."
    }
